message: "If you use FRP Trace Observatory, please cite the software using these metadata."
title: "FRP Trace Observatory"
abstract: >-
  FRP Trace Observatory is a deterministic, read-only validation, audit,
  trace-exploration, and transition-visualization layer for published Fractal
  Resonance Processor artifacts. Version 1.0.3 carries the qualified
  Observatory M22 implementation and evidence boundary through the enabled
  GitHub-Zenodo release integration over the FRP v3.3.0 M31 publication
  boundary, while retaining the qualified M30 evidence chain, exact
  provenance, deterministic identities, and separate measurement contours.
